{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 92,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.1127624511719,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "they had: 1) WHO-defined severe malaria; 2) seizures, or an altered/impaired state of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        336.0029602050781,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "consciousness; and 3) hypoglycaemia (blood gluocose < 3.3 mmol/L).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.0815734863281,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Twenty-six children were randomly allocated to receive sublingual sugar (a",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.0828857421875,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "teaspoon [2.5–3.5 g] of moistened sugar; n = 14) or intravenous sugar (5 ml/kg",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.09283447265625,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "10% glucose; n = 12). Sublingual administration was repeated every 20 minutes for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.1128845214844,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "2  hours. Primary outcome was treatment response rate: reaching a blood glucose",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.1128234863281,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "> 3.3 mmol/L during the first 40 minutes. Secondary outcomes included relapse rate",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        141.3428955078125,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "and treatment delay.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.10150146484375,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "The only difference in baseline characteristics was a trend towards more children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.11309814453125,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "with coma in the intravenous group (p = 0.06). There was no significant difference",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.11285400390625,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "in the treatment response rate (71% in sublingual and 67% in intravenous, p = 0.81).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.0527648925781,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "However, there was a trend towards more relapses in the sublingual group (30%",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.0628356933594,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "versus 17%, p=0.55). Treatment delay was longer for the intravenous group (18.9",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        399.1827087402344,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "minutes versus 5 minutes), and due to this, the increase in blood glucose from time",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        241.7421112060547,
        322.432861328125,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "of diagnosis of hypoglycaemia was faster in the sublingual group.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        254.7421112060547,
        399.0814514160156,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Complications: two children in the sublingual group swallowed the sugar, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        267.7420959472656,
        399.0428161621094,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "failed to reach normo-glycaemia by 40 minutes. According to study protocol, they",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.7420959472656,
        399.09295654296875,
        294.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "were switched to intravenous delivery. In the intravenous group, the infusion was",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        293.7420959472656,
        141.06288146972656,
        307.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "blocked in one child.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        318.2607116699219,
        163.96287536621094,
        330.2507019042969
      ],
      "text": "11.1.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        333.9053955078125,
        88.77290344238281,
        346.0453796386719
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        346.9153747558594,
        399.1230163574219,
        360.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Sublingual sugar appears to be well-tolerated, safe, and efficacious. It is easy to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        359.9153747558594,
        399.0427551269531,
        373.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "administer, rapidly increases blood glucose levels, and is better than no treatment",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        372.9153747558594,
        399.082763671875,
        386.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "in situations where IV glucose infusion may be delayed or not available. It can be",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        385.9153747558594,
        399.14300537109375,
        399.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "administered by unskilled health-care workers or parents as a first-aid measure in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        398.9153747558594,
        163.64291381835938,
        412.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "many rural health centres.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        420.4093017578125,
        78.65290069580078,
        432.5492858886719
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        433.4192810058594,
        399.0027770996094,
        446.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Possibility of treatment failures because of clenched teeth and swallowing of the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        446.4192810058594,
        399.0628662109375,
        459.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "sugar. It has 30% hypoglycaemia relapse and could give false confidence in situations",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        459.4192810058594,
        259.5429382324219,
        472.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "where blood glucose levels may not be monitored.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        483.9378967285156,
        205.30300903320312,
        495.9278869628906
      ],
      "text": "11.1.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        499.59246826171875,
        399.12274169921875,
        513.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "Sublingual sugar is child-friendly, easy to administer, and does not require skilled",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        512.5924682617188,
        399.1227722167969,
        526.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "health workers. Children will not be distressed due to inserting an IV line and would",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        525.5924682617188,
        399.06280517578125,
        539.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "be a more acceptable treatment than IV infusions. Active participation by parents",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        538.5924682617188,
        399.11279296875,
        552.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "in the care of their children may also increase. As sugar is readily available in most",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        551.5924682617188,
        399.093017578125,
        565.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "places, it may be immediately administered in most circumstances and does not",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        564.5924682617188,
        399.0829162597656,
        578.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "require a prescription or other additional materials for use. It is easy to implement",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        577.5924682617188,
        399.09283447265625,
        591.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "widely in all settings, including peripheral health centres and in the communities",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        590.5924682617188,
        228.12289428710938,
        604.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "where intravenous glucose is not available.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.45919799804688,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.58619689941406,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "78",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}